   "manual": "GOAT control: grind card advantage, then close with a fat beater.\nKey combo: Scapegoat into Metamorphosis — tribute one Sheep Token to Special Summon Thousand-Eyes Restrict, then absorb their best monster.\nOpen with Pot of Greed / Graceful Charity / Delinquent Duo to dig; hold Heavy Storm and Mystical Space Typhoon for their backrow.\nTrade with Tribe-Infecting Virus, Breaker, and Airknight Parshath; recur threats with Premature Burial and Call of the Haunted.\nProtect the combo with Book of Moon and the trap suite (Mirror Force, Torrential Tribute, Ring of Destruction).",
